      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1503,
      "text": "O my people, who would protect me from Allah if I were to dismiss them? Will you not then take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 225,
      "ruku": 185,
      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1504,
      "text": "I do not tell you that I have Allah’s treasures or that I know the unseen, nor do I say that I am an angel. Nor do I say about those whom you look down upon, that Allah will never grant them any good, for Allah knows best what is in their hearts. If I did so, I would surely be one of the wrongdoers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 225,
      "ruku": 185,
      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1505,
      "text": "They said, “O Noah, you have argued far too much with us, so bring what you are threatening us with, if you are one of the truthful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 225,
      "ruku": 185,
      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1506,
      "text": "He said, “It is only Allah Who can bring it upon you if He wills, then you will have no escape.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 225,
      "ruku": 185,
      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1507,
      "text": "Nor will my advice benefit you – no matter how hard I try – if Allah wills to leave you astray. He is your Lord, and to Him you will be returned.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 225,
      "ruku": 185,
      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1508,
      "text": "Or do they say that he has fabricated it”? Say [O Prophet], “If I did fabricate it, then I am responsible for my sin, but I am innocent of the sins you commit.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 225,
      "ruku": 185,
      "hizbQuarter": 90,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1509,
      "text": "It was revealed to Noah, “None of your people will ever believe except those who have already believed. So do not grieve over what they do[16].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
